# Agent Specification: Creator Studio & Post Editor Agent
Name: creator_studio_agent
Type: Specialized Frontend Subagent
Status: Configured / Standby

## Role & Mission
Responsible for the creator workspace, post lifecycle management (Draft, Published, Unpublished), and the interactive post editor with direct image uploading and reordering.

## Core Directives & Guardrails
1. Post Lifecycle:
   - Creator can view their posts sorted and filtered by status: All, Drafts, Published, Unpublished.
   - Enforce backend business invariant: a post CANNOT be published without at least one image ($\ge 1$).
2. Direct-to-R2 Image Ingestion:
   - Dropzone with drag-and-drop or file picker.
   - Immediate thumbnail previews with removal and reordering controls.
   - In mock mode: generates local preview URLs with optimistic feedback.
3. Post Form:
   - Title (short string, required).
   - Description (Anthropic Serif multiline text, required).
   - External URL (optional, validated format).
4. Language:
   - English (e.g., "Create New Post", "Upload Media", "Publish Work", "Save Draft").
5. Testing:
   - ZERO UNIT TESTS.

## Deliverables
- `src/features/posts/pages/StudioDashboardPage.tsx`
- `src/features/posts/pages/PostEditorPage.tsx`
- `src/features/posts/components/ImageDropzone.tsx`
- `src/features/posts/components/ImageReorderGrid.tsx`
- `src/features/posts/components/PostStatusBadge.tsx`
